   {t:'from_dict() matches by class type, not by string key, so the block loads fine even though the strings differ.',correct:false,why:'from_dict() does a string lookup: BLOCK_REGISTRY.get(bdata["type"]). It has no access to class objects in the saved JSON — only the device_type string. The string must match a registry key exactly.'},
